#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1788
msgid ""
"CartPops could not finish updating your settings from version 1, so it is "
"paused. Your settings are safe. Reload this page to try again, and contact "
"CartPops support if this message stays."
msgstr ""
"CartPops nije mogao završiti ažuriranje vaših postavki iz verzije 1, pa je "
"pauziran. Vaše postavke su sigurne. Ponovno učitajte ovu stranicu da "
"pokušate ponovno, i kontaktirajte CartPops podršku ako se ova poruka "
"nastavi."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1798
msgid ""
"Your automation rules from CartPops 1 are kept, but CartPops 2 no longer "
"runs them."
msgstr ""
"Vaša pravila automatizacije iz CartPops 1 su zadržana, ali CartPops 2 ih "
"više ne pokreće."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1821
msgid ""
"CartPops updated your settings from version 1, but some could not be "
"carried over exactly. Your original settings are kept."
msgstr ""
"CartPops je ažurirao vaše postavke iz verzije 1, ali neke nisu mogle biti "
"prenesene točno. Vaše izvorne postavke su zadržane."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1825
msgid "Hide this notice"
msgstr "Sakrij ovu obavijest"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1835
msgid "This review requires a site administrator and a submitted review form."
msgstr "Ovaj pregled zahtijeva administratora web-mjesta i poslanu formu pregleda."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1852
msgid ""
"The review was not accepted. Return to this site dashboard and review the "
"current notice again."
msgstr ""
"Pregled nije prihvaćen. Vratite se na nadzornu ploču ovog web-mjesta i "
"ponovno pregledajte trenutnu obavijest."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1857
msgid ""
"The saved migration state could not be acknowledged. No review was "
"accepted; return to this site dashboard and try again."
msgstr ""
"Spremljeno stanje migracije nije moglo biti potvrđeno. Nijedan pregled nije "
"prihvaćen; vratite se na nadzornu ploču ovog web-mjesta i pokušajte ponovno."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1865
msgid ""
"JavaScript retirement review accepted. Return to this site dashboard to "
"retry migration and review any remaining conditions. The original script is "
"preserved and will not execute in V2."
msgstr ""
"Pregled umirovljenja JavaScripta prihvaćen. Vratite se na nadzornu ploču "
"web-mjesta da pokušate ponovno migraciju i pregledajte sve preostale "
"uvjete. Izvorni skript je sačuvan i neće se izvršiti u V2."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1909
msgid "This link has expired. Return to the dashboard and try again."
msgstr "Ovaj link je istekao. Vratite se na nadzornu ploču i pokušajte ponovno."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1925
msgid ""
"CartPops is paused until you review your old custom JavaScript below. Your "
"settings are safe."
msgstr ""
"CartPops je pauziran dok ne pregledaš svoj stari prilagođeni JavaScript "
"ispod. Vaše postavke su sigurne."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1926
msgid ""
"CartPops is paused until a site administrator reviews the old custom "
"JavaScript. Your settings are safe."
msgstr ""
"CartPops je pauziran dok administrator web-mjesta ne pregleda stari "
"prilagođeni JavaScript. Vaše postavke su sigurne."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1928
msgid ""
"CartPops is paused until its update can finish. Your settings are safe. If "
"you use CartPops Pro, check that your license is active for this site; "
"otherwise, contact CartPops support."
msgstr ""
"CartPops je pauziran dok se ažuriranje ne završi. Vaše postavke su sigurne. "
"Ako koristite CartPops Pro, provjerite je li vaša licenca aktivna za ovu "
"stranicu; u suprotnom, kontaktirajte CartPops podršku."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1938
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Saznaj više"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1948
msgid ""
"These settings had a value CartPops 2 could not read, so they now use their "
"default. Check them in the CartPops settings:"
msgstr ""
"Ove postavke su imale vrijednost koju CartPops 2 nije mogao pročitati, pa "
"sada koriste zadanu vrijednost. Provjerite ih u CartPops postavkama:"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1949
msgid "These settings no longer exist in CartPops 2:"
msgstr "Ove postavke više ne postoje u CartPops 2:"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1950
msgid "These settings now work a little differently:"
msgstr "Ove postavke sada funkcioniraju malo drugačije:"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1964
msgid "Your custom JavaScript from version 1 is kept but not run."
msgstr "Vaš prilagođeni JavaScript iz verzije 1 je sačuvan, ali se ne izvršava."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1967
msgid "Some Pro settings from version 1 are kept in your database but not used."
msgstr ""
"Neke Pro postavke iz verzije 1 su sačuvane u vašoj bazi podataka, ali se ne "
"koriste."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1973
#. translators: %d: number of other settings.
#, php-format
msgid "%d other setting could not be carried over."
msgid_plural "%d other settings could not be carried over."
msgstr[0] "%d druga postavka nije mogla biti prebačena."
msgstr[1] "%d druge postavke nisu mogle biti prebačene."
msgstr[2] "%d ostalih postavki nije moglo biti prebačeno."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1982
msgid "See which settings"
msgstr "Pogledaj koje postavke"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2000
msgid "Show your saved custom JavaScript"
msgstr "Prikaži svoj sačuvani prilagođeni JavaScript"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2001
msgid ""
"Copy it somewhere safe if you want to move it into your theme or a snippets "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"Kopiraj ga negdje sigurno ako ga želiš premjestiti u svoju temu ili plugin "
"za isječke."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2004
msgid "Only the beginning is shown. The full copy remains saved in your database."
msgstr ""
"Prikazano je samo početak. Puna kopija ostaje sačuvana u vašoj bazi "
"podataka."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2022
msgid "Review your old custom JavaScript"
msgstr "Pregledaj svoj stari prilagođeni JavaScript"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2023
msgid ""
"CartPops 2 does not run the custom JavaScript from version 1. It stays "
"saved in your database. Copy it if you still need it, then confirm below to "
"finish the update."
msgstr ""
"CartPops 2 ne izvršava prilagođeni JavaScript iz verzije 1. Ostaje sačuvan "
"u vašoj bazi podataka. Kopiraj ga ako ga još trebas, zatim potvrdi ispod da "
"završiš ažuriranje."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2039
msgid "I understand this custom JavaScript will not run in CartPops 2."
msgstr "Razumijem da se ovaj prilagođeni JavaScript neće izvršavati u CartPops 2."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2041
msgid "Confirm and finish the update"
msgstr "Potvrdi i završi ažuriranje"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2060
msgid "Open this site dashboard to review its migration"
msgstr "Otvori nadzornu ploču ove stranice da pregledasš njezinu migraciju"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2072
msgid "Return to this site dashboard"
msgstr "Vrati se na nadzornu ploču ove stranice"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2073
msgid "CartPops migration review"
msgstr "Pregled migracije CartPops"

#: src/Admin/assets/js/pages/AdvancedSettings.jsx:244
msgid "Add to cart on product pages without reloading"
msgstr "Dodaj u košaricu na stranicama proizvoda bez osvježavanja"

#: src/Admin/assets/js/pages/AdvancedSettings.jsx:248
msgid ""
"Adds the product in the background so shoppers stay on the page. The drawer "
"then opens if “Open drawer on” is set to Add to cart. Turn this off if your "
"theme or another plugin already handles product-page add to cart."
msgstr ""
"Dodaje proizvod u pozadini kako bi kupci ostali na stranici. Ladica se "
"zatim otvara ako je \"Otvori ladicu na\" postavljeno na Dodaj u košaricu. "
"Isključi ovo ako tvoja tema ili drugi plugin već obrađuje dodavanje u "
"košaricu na stranici proizvoda."

#: src/Pro/Admin/assets/js/pages/ShippingMeterSettings.jsx:325
msgid "WooCommerce minimum"
msgstr "Minimum WooCommerce"

#: src/Pro/Admin/assets/js/pages/ShippingMeterSettings.jsx:337
msgid ""
"Free shipping comes from WooCommerce, not from this meter. Add a Free "
"shipping method with a minimum order amount to your shipping zones in "
"WooCommerce → Settings → Shipping. The meter only shows when the shopper’s "
"zone has one."
msgstr ""
"Besplatna dostava dolazi iz WooCommerce-a, a ne iz ovog brojača. Dodaj "
"metodu Besplatna dostava s minimalnim iznosom narudžbe u svoje zone dostave "
"u WooCommerce → Postavke → Dostava. Brojač se prikazuje samo kada zona "
"kupca ima jednu."

#: src/Pro/Admin/assets/js/pages/ShippingMeterSettings.jsx:345
msgid "Higher free shipping goal (optional)"
msgstr "Viši cilj besplatne dostave (neobavezno)"

#: src/Pro/Admin/assets/js/pages/ShippingMeterSettings.jsx:349
msgid ""
"Leave at 0 to use the minimum order amount from WooCommerce. A higher "
"amount only raises the goal shown in the meter. It does not give free "
"shipping by itself, and amounts below the WooCommerce minimum are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Ostavi na 0 da koristiš minimalni iznos narudžbe iz WooCommerce-a. Viši "
"iznos samo povećava cilj prikazan u brojačу. Ne daje besplatnu dostavu sam "
"po sebi, a iznosi ispod WooCommerce minimuma se zanemaruju."

